msgstr "【\\N[\\V[6]]】「……呜呜呜………」"

#. ID 40, Page 3, Line 26, Pos (37,13)
#. ID 40, Page 4, Line 26, Pos (37,13)
#. ID 40, Page 5, Line 38, Pos (37,13)
